---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import FAQPageSchema from '../components/FAQPageSchema.astro';
import LocalBusinessSchema from '../components/LocalBusinessSchema.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';

const faqs = [
  { q: "How far is AllStar from Kenilworth?", a: "Under 5 minutes for most Kenilworth addresses. 1166 West Chestnut St, Union, NJ 07083. Free parking on-site." },
  { q: "How does AllStar compare to Rolling Bear BJJ?", a: "Both are real BJJ schools. The distinction is coaching background — Jamal Patterson competed professionally at the highest levels. We also offer Muay Thai and MMA, which Rolling Bear does not." },
  { q: "What programs run in the evenings?", a: "Adult BJJ, Muay Thai, and MMA run evenings Monday through Friday at 6, 7, and 8 PM. Kids classes run late afternoon." },
  { q: "Do I need gear to start?", a: "Not for the trial. We provide everything for your first two weeks." },
  { q: "Can I try a class before committing?", a: "That's the whole point of the trial. Come in, try it, decide." },
  { q: "How do I start?", a: "Fill out the form on this page or call (908) 341-1131." },
];
---

<PageLayout
  title="Martial Arts in Kenilworth, NJ — BJJ, MMA & Muay Thai | AllStar"
  description="Martial arts classes for Kenilworth, NJ residents at AllStar Martial Arts in Union. BJJ, Muay Thai, MMA, and Kids programs. Renzo Gracie black belt. Free 2-week trial."
  ogImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <LocalBusinessSchema city="Kenilworth" />
    <FAQPageSchema faqs={faqs} />
  </Fragment>

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="5 minutes from Kenilworth"
    headline="Martial Arts in Kenilworth, NJ"
    sub="Practically a straight shot down the Boulevard — BJJ, Muay Thai, MMA, and kids programs about 5 minutes from your front door. Free 2-week trial, no contract."
    bgImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
  />

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Kenilworth and Union basically share a fence line along the Route 22 corridor, which makes AllStar one of the closest gyms in the county to you — under five minutes from most Kenilworth addresses. You're practically neighbors.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        Which is exactly why it's surprising how many Kenilworth residents have never come through the door. AllStar Martial Arts sits at 1166 West Chestnut St in Union, just across the border past the Boulevard. Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu, Muay Thai, MMA, and kids programs, all run by a Renzo Gracie black belt who fought professionally in the IFL and Bellator. It's a family-owned room that's been here since 2011 — and the first two weeks are free. Curious how the <a href="/trial/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">free trial</a> works?
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BJJ -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-gray-light">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">BJJ Near Kenilworth, NJ</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Let's be straight: Rolling Bear BJJ is right here in Kenilworth, they're a real school, and they run a solid program with over 40 classes a month. Worth saying honestly.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        The specific difference at AllStar is Coach Jamal Patterson's competition background — ADCC veteran, professional fights in the IFL and Bellator, UWC light heavyweight champion. That depth of competition experience changes how technique gets explained and drilled, and Kenilworth members who've trained at both have drawn that comparison themselves. For most Kenilworth addresses we're also a couple minutes closer. See the full <a href="/adult-bjj/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">adult BJJ</a> program.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kids -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Kids Programs</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">Kids Martial Arts Near Kenilworth, NJ</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-gold">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Cubs — Ages 4–6</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Preschool martial arts designed around big energy and short attention spans. Coordination, listening, and confidence, built through movement and games — and Kenilworth parents from Boulevard Elementary to Harding notice the results fast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-navy">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Lions — Ages 7–13</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Real BJJ for kids ready to put in work — progressive belt system, real technique, real challenge. The reasons Kenilworth parents (many with kids headed to David Brearley) sign up: after-school structure, bully concerns, confidence, and an activity their kid will actually stick with.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Muay Thai + MMA -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-4xl">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">Muay Thai</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">Closest Muay Thai to Kenilworth</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            Kenilworth doesn't have a Muay Thai gym, so the closest authentic instruction is right here — about five minutes down the road. Real pad work, real coaching, and adults of every fitness level are welcome. A fitness-studio class hands you choreography; Muay Thai at AllStar hands you an actual skill.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">MMA</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">MMA Near Kenilworth, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            Our MMA program blends BJJ, Muay Thai, and wrestling into one system, coached by Jamal Patterson — adults 16 and up. For Kenilworth residents, it's the closest MMA coaching led by a genuine professional fight veteran you'll find. Neighbors in <a href="/roselle-park/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Roselle Park</a> and <a href="/cranford/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Cranford</a> train alongside you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Landmarks -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">If you know Kenilworth</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brand-black mb-5">Five Minutes From All Of It</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {["Kenilworth Town Center", "Boulevard Elementary", "Harding Elementary", "David Brearley High School", "Kenilworth Community Pool", "Kenilworth Recreation", "Boulevard Ave", "Route 22 corridor"].map((l) => (
          <span class="bg-brand-gray-light text-brand-gray px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">📍 {l}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FAQ items={faqs} />

  <CTA
    headline="Two Weeks Free — Kenilworth Residents Welcome"
    sub="Show up. Bring water. We'll handle the rest. No commitment, no pressure."
  />
</PageLayout>
